{"path":".agents/skills/domain-modeling/CONTEXT-FORMAT.md","ref":"1f305ea273a1133774b6a1eda851a5ad99278ad3","side":"old","lines":[{"sha":"6f1ffa22efab53e01b685ffdc4b369fd395ae9c7","author":"Máté Molnár","timestamp":1779743256,"line":1,"text":"# CONTEXT.md Format"},{"sha":"6f1ffa22efab53e01b685ffdc4b369fd395ae9c7","author":"Máté Molnár","timestamp":1779743256,"line":2,"text":""},{"sha":"6f1ffa22efab53e01b685ffdc4b369fd395ae9c7","author":"Máté Molnár","timestamp":1779743256,"line":3,"text":"## Structure"},{"sha":"6f1ffa22efab53e01b685ffdc4b369fd395ae9c7","author":"Máté Molnár","timestamp":1779743256,"line":4,"text":""},{"sha":"6f1ffa22efab53e01b685ffdc4b369fd395ae9c7","author":"Máté Molnár","timestamp":1779743256,"line":5,"text":"```md"},{"sha":"6f1ffa22efab53e01b685ffdc4b369fd395ae9c7","author":"Máté Molnár","timestamp":1779743256,"line":6,"text":"# {Context Name}"},{"sha":"6f1ffa22efab53e01b685ffdc4b369fd395ae9c7","author":"Máté Molnár","timestamp":1779743256,"line":7,"text":""},{"sha":"6f1ffa22efab53e01b685ffdc4b369fd395ae9c7","author":"Máté Molnár","timestamp":1779743256,"line":8,"text":"{One or two sentence description of what this context is and why it exists.}"},{"sha":"6f1ffa22efab53e01b685ffdc4b369fd395ae9c7","author":"Máté Molnár","timestamp":1779743256,"line":9,"text":""},{"sha":"6f1ffa22efab53e01b685ffdc4b369fd395ae9c7","author":"Máté Molnár","timestamp":1779743256,"line":10,"text":"## Language"},{"sha":"6f1ffa22efab53e01b685ffdc4b369fd395ae9c7","author":"Máté Molnár","timestamp":1779743256,"line":11,"text":""},{"sha":"6f1ffa22efab53e01b685ffdc4b369fd395ae9c7","author":"Máté Molnár","timestamp":1779743256,"line":12,"text":"**Order**:"},{"sha":"6f1ffa22efab53e01b685ffdc4b369fd395ae9c7","author":"Máté Molnár","timestamp":1779743256,"line":13,"text":"{A one or two sentence description of the term}"},{"sha":"6f1ffa22efab53e01b685ffdc4b369fd395ae9c7","author":"Máté Molnár","timestamp":1779743256,"line":14,"text":"_Avoid_: Purchase, transaction"},{"sha":"6f1ffa22efab53e01b685ffdc4b369fd395ae9c7","author":"Máté Molnár","timestamp":1779743256,"line":15,"text":""},{"sha":"6f1ffa22efab53e01b685ffdc4b369fd395ae9c7","author":"Máté Molnár","timestamp":1779743256,"line":16,"text":"**Invoice**:"},{"sha":"6f1ffa22efab53e01b685ffdc4b369fd395ae9c7","author":"Máté Molnár","timestamp":1779743256,"line":17,"text":"A request for payment sent to a customer after delivery."},{"sha":"6f1ffa22efab53e01b685ffdc4b369fd395ae9c7","author":"Máté Molnár","timestamp":1779743256,"line":18,"text":"_Avoid_: Bill, payment request"},{"sha":"6f1ffa22efab53e01b685ffdc4b369fd395ae9c7","author":"Máté Molnár","timestamp":1779743256,"line":19,"text":""},{"sha":"6f1ffa22efab53e01b685ffdc4b369fd395ae9c7","author":"Máté Molnár","timestamp":1779743256,"line":20,"text":"**Customer**:"},{"sha":"6f1ffa22efab53e01b685ffdc4b369fd395ae9c7","author":"Máté Molnár","timestamp":1779743256,"line":21,"text":"A person or organization that places orders."},{"sha":"6f1ffa22efab53e01b685ffdc4b369fd395ae9c7","author":"Máté Molnár","timestamp":1779743256,"line":22,"text":"_Avoid_: Client, buyer, account"},{"sha":"6f1ffa22efab53e01b685ffdc4b369fd395ae9c7","author":"Máté Molnár","timestamp":1779743256,"line":23,"text":"```"},{"sha":"6f1ffa22efab53e01b685ffdc4b369fd395ae9c7","author":"Máté Molnár","timestamp":1779743256,"line":24,"text":""},{"sha":"6f1ffa22efab53e01b685ffdc4b369fd395ae9c7","author":"Máté Molnár","timestamp":1779743256,"line":25,"text":"## Rules"},{"sha":"6f1ffa22efab53e01b685ffdc4b369fd395ae9c7","author":"Máté Molnár","timestamp":1779743256,"line":26,"text":""},{"sha":"65b2b1f6292bb4d9bc8b703035bcceec33cbb2dc","author":"matemolnar8","timestamp":1781447338,"line":27,"text":"- **Be opinionated.** When multiple words exist for the same concept, pick the best one and list the others under `_Avoid_`."},{"sha":"6f1ffa22efab53e01b685ffdc4b369fd395ae9c7","author":"Máté Molnár","timestamp":1779743256,"line":28,"text":"- **Keep definitions tight.** One or two sentences max. Define what it IS, not what it does."},{"sha":"6f1ffa22efab53e01b685ffdc4b369fd395ae9c7","author":"Máté Molnár","timestamp":1779743256,"line":29,"text":"- **Only include terms specific to this project's context.** General programming concepts (timeouts, error types, utility patterns) don't belong even if the project uses them extensively. Before adding a term, ask: is this a concept unique to this context, or a general programming concept? Only the former belongs."},{"sha":"6f1ffa22efab53e01b685ffdc4b369fd395ae9c7","author":"Máté Molnár","timestamp":1779743256,"line":30,"text":"- **Group terms under subheadings** when natural clusters emerge. If all terms belong to a single cohesive area, a flat list is fine."},{"sha":"6f1ffa22efab53e01b685ffdc4b369fd395ae9c7","author":"Máté Molnár","timestamp":1779743256,"line":31,"text":""},{"sha":"6f1ffa22efab53e01b685ffdc4b369fd395ae9c7","author":"Máté Molnár","timestamp":1779743256,"line":32,"text":"## Single vs multi-context repos"},{"sha":"6f1ffa22efab53e01b685ffdc4b369fd395ae9c7","author":"Máté Molnár","timestamp":1779743256,"line":33,"text":""},{"sha":"6f1ffa22efab53e01b685ffdc4b369fd395ae9c7","author":"Máté Molnár","timestamp":1779743256,"line":34,"text":"**Single context (most repos):** One `CONTEXT.md` at the repo root."},{"sha":"6f1ffa22efab53e01b685ffdc4b369fd395ae9c7","author":"Máté Molnár","timestamp":1779743256,"line":35,"text":""},{"sha":"6f1ffa22efab53e01b685ffdc4b369fd395ae9c7","author":"Máté Molnár","timestamp":1779743256,"line":36,"text":"**Multiple contexts:** A `CONTEXT-MAP.md` at the repo root lists the contexts, where they live, and how they relate to each other:"},{"sha":"6f1ffa22efab53e01b685ffdc4b369fd395ae9c7","author":"Máté Molnár","timestamp":1779743256,"line":37,"text":""},{"sha":"6f1ffa22efab53e01b685ffdc4b369fd395ae9c7","author":"Máté Molnár","timestamp":1779743256,"line":38,"text":"```md"},{"sha":"6f1ffa22efab53e01b685ffdc4b369fd395ae9c7","author":"Máté Molnár","timestamp":1779743256,"line":39,"text":"# Context Map"},{"sha":"6f1ffa22efab53e01b685ffdc4b369fd395ae9c7","author":"Máté Molnár","timestamp":1779743256,"line":40,"text":""},{"sha":"6f1ffa22efab53e01b685ffdc4b369fd395ae9c7","author":"Máté Molnár","timestamp":1779743256,"line":41,"text":"## Contexts"},{"sha":"6f1ffa22efab53e01b685ffdc4b369fd395ae9c7","author":"Máté Molnár","timestamp":1779743256,"line":42,"text":""},{"sha":"6f1ffa22efab53e01b685ffdc4b369fd395ae9c7","author":"Máté Molnár","timestamp":1779743256,"line":43,"text":"- [Ordering](./src/ordering/CONTEXT.md) — receives and tracks customer orders"},{"sha":"6f1ffa22efab53e01b685ffdc4b369fd395ae9c7","author":"Máté Molnár","timestamp":1779743256,"line":44,"text":"- [Billing](./src/billing/CONTEXT.md) — generates invoices and processes payments"},{"sha":"6f1ffa22efab53e01b685ffdc4b369fd395ae9c7","author":"Máté Molnár","timestamp":1779743256,"line":45,"text":"- [Fulfillment](./src/fulfillment/CONTEXT.md) — manages warehouse picking and shipping"},{"sha":"6f1ffa22efab53e01b685ffdc4b369fd395ae9c7","author":"Máté Molnár","timestamp":1779743256,"line":46,"text":""},{"sha":"6f1ffa22efab53e01b685ffdc4b369fd395ae9c7","author":"Máté Molnár","timestamp":1779743256,"line":47,"text":"## Relationships"},{"sha":"6f1ffa22efab53e01b685ffdc4b369fd395ae9c7","author":"Máté Molnár","timestamp":1779743256,"line":48,"text":""},{"sha":"6f1ffa22efab53e01b685ffdc4b369fd395ae9c7","author":"Máté Molnár","timestamp":1779743256,"line":49,"text":"- **Ordering → Fulfillment**: Ordering emits `OrderPlaced` events; Fulfillment consumes them to start picking"},{"sha":"6f1ffa22efab53e01b685ffdc4b369fd395ae9c7","author":"Máté Molnár","timestamp":1779743256,"line":50,"text":"- **Fulfillment → Billing**: Fulfillment emits `ShipmentDispatched` events; Billing consumes them to generate invoices"},{"sha":"6f1ffa22efab53e01b685ffdc4b369fd395ae9c7","author":"Máté Molnár","timestamp":1779743256,"line":51,"text":"- **Ordering ↔ Billing**: Shared types for `CustomerId` and `Money`"},{"sha":"6f1ffa22efab53e01b685ffdc4b369fd395ae9c7","author":"Máté Molnár","timestamp":1779743256,"line":52,"text":"```"},{"sha":"6f1ffa22efab53e01b685ffdc4b369fd395ae9c7","author":"Máté Molnár","timestamp":1779743256,"line":53,"text":""},{"sha":"6f1ffa22efab53e01b685ffdc4b369fd395ae9c7","author":"Máté Molnár","timestamp":1779743256,"line":54,"text":"The skill infers which structure applies:"},{"sha":"6f1ffa22efab53e01b685ffdc4b369fd395ae9c7","author":"Máté Molnár","timestamp":1779743256,"line":55,"text":""},{"sha":"6f1ffa22efab53e01b685ffdc4b369fd395ae9c7","author":"Máté Molnár","timestamp":1779743256,"line":56,"text":"- If `CONTEXT-MAP.md` exists, read it to find contexts"},{"sha":"6f1ffa22efab53e01b685ffdc4b369fd395ae9c7","author":"Máté Molnár","timestamp":1779743256,"line":57,"text":"- If only a root `CONTEXT.md` exists, single context"},{"sha":"6f1ffa22efab53e01b685ffdc4b369fd395ae9c7","author":"Máté Molnár","timestamp":1779743256,"line":58,"text":"- If neither exists, create a root `CONTEXT.md` lazily when the first term is resolved"},{"sha":"6f1ffa22efab53e01b685ffdc4b369fd395ae9c7","author":"Máté Molnár","timestamp":1779743256,"line":59,"text":""},{"sha":"6f1ffa22efab53e01b685ffdc4b369fd395ae9c7","author":"Máté Molnár","timestamp":1779743256,"line":60,"text":"When multiple contexts exist, infer which one the current topic relates to. If unclear, ask."}]}
